{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a new monster hunter in Raven Tear County. You are new to the business, with no money, no knowledge of the area, and only your trusty dog \u200b\u200bby your side. Long days of farming, fishing, and genociding the local monsters await you.\u00a0Grow carrots or something less legal; try your luck on a bet, catching local predatory fish or someone's boot; trade to earn yourself a cool weapon and its upgrade; buy yourself a car to explore the most remote corners of the area - show who is the boss in this area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&lt;&lt;Farming&gt;&gt;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640760/extras/YouCut_20250411_153314945__1_.gif?t=1745161212\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plant vegetables, fruits and forbidden plants to earn money for equipment. Each plant has its own growth time and care criteria. Water, fertilize, monitor health and harvest your crops. Explore the area to find more and more diverse plants to plant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&lt;&lt;Exploration&gt;&gt;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640760/extras/Trip.gif?t=1745161212\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buy a car, grab some friends and explore a variety of locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&lt;&lt;Fishing&gt;&gt;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640760/extras/Fishing.gif?t=1745161212\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buy a fishing rod and enjoy the peace of mind while waiting for your catch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&lt;&lt;Trade&gt;&gt;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640760/extras/Shop.gif?t=1745161212\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sell \u200b\u200byour finds, upgrade your weapons, and buy gear for household tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&lt;&lt;Destroying Monsters&gt;&gt;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640760/extras/Bullet.gif?t=1745161212\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buy a weapon to your taste, upgrade it to the maximum, put on armor and send local monsters back to hell. Explore the area together in search of anomalous monsters for a special reward for their heads. Subjugate the Raven Tear district together with friends in a co-op of up to 4 people.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3640760?t=1745161212","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640760/949ba025fc76ab0df6b872f81c6c0c893044b790/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745161212","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640760/f5110b0e7ac7155236c736cd7e3fb49dda64a166/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745161212","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640760/f5110b0e7ac7155236c736cd7e3fb49dda64a166/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745161212","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game contains scenes of violence, foul language and prohibited substances.\r\nWe are against the use of drugs and any form of violence, it harms your life. All scenes in the game are presented for entertainment purposes."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a new monster hunter in Raven Tear County. You are new to the business, with no money, no knowledge of the area, and only your trusty dog \u200b\u200bby your side. Long days of farming, fishing, and genociding the local monsters await you.\u00a0Grow carrots or something less legal; try your luck on a bet, catching local predatory fish or someone's boot; trade to earn yourself a cool weapon and its upgrade; buy yourself a car to explore the most remote corners of the area - show who is the boss in this area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&lt;&lt;Farming&gt;&gt;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640760/extras/YouCut_20250411_153314945__1_.gif?t=1745161212\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plant vegetables, fruits and forbidden plants to earn money for equipment. Each plant has its own growth time and care criteria. Water, fertilize, monitor health and harvest your crops. Explore the area to find more and more diverse plants to plant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&lt;&lt;Exploration&gt;&gt;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640760/extras/Trip.gif?t=1745161212\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buy a car, grab some friends and explore a variety of locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&lt;&lt;Fishing&gt;&gt;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640760/extras/Fishing.gif?t=1745161212\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buy a fishing rod and enjoy the peace of mind while waiting for your catch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&lt;&lt;Trade&gt;&gt;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640760/extras/Shop.gif?t=1745161212\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sell \u200b\u200byour finds, upgrade your weapons, and buy gear for household tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&lt;&lt;Destroying Monsters&gt;&gt;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640760/extras/Bullet.gif?t=1745161212\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buy a weapon to your taste, upgrade it to the maximum, put on armor and send local monsters back to hell. Explore the area together in search of anomalous monsters for a special reward for their heads. Subjugate the Raven Tear district together with friends in a co-op of up to 4 people.</p>","developers":["Thirteen Frogs"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640760/d6563a40fd6ae838810bf1b0ff0d55a467209017/header.jpg?t=1745161212","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257125011,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125011/movie480.mp4?t=1744648622","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125011/movie_max.mp4?t=1744648622"},"name":"Raven Tear: Season 0 Deluxe Edition - Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257125011/a5795f2a956332f4d2dd7fd9a53ecd49a47fdd5c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744648622","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125011/movie480_vp9.webm?